# AtCoder ABC170 A - Five Variables
# https://atcoder.jp/contests/abc170/tasks/abc170_a

Polike kas x1 kasta x2 kasta x3 kasta x4 kasta x5 vos stdin.
Sonome kas values tas [x1, x2, x3, x4, x5].
Sonome kas i tas 1.

Pilike kas x pas values {
    Palusta x kate "0" {
        Takute kas i.
        Kinise.
    }
    Kemese kas i tas i + 1.
}
